        ecrm:P126_employed      "silk and metal"@en ;
        ecrm:P32_used_general_technique
                "Combination of two stuctures: 4 harness irregular twill [foundation] plus 3/1 twill \\ [supplementary facing and pattern]. Foundation fabric has an integrated set of supplementary wefts free floating on the front to pattern. The supplementary fabric has a set of two complementary weft faces the pattern background covering the 4 harness twill"@en , "and the other backs the discontinuous wefts. The discontinuous supplementary wefts pattern and are bound by the interlaces with the foundation wefts in 2/2 twill."@en ;
